  "settingsAboutMissionTitle": "Our mission",
  "settingsAboutMission": "Every year lakhs of young people across Bangladesh prepare for BCS, bank and other government job exams — many without expensive coaching. Prostuti brings quality preparation to every phone: a sourced question bank, BCS-pattern model tests, daily current-affairs notes and a personal study plan, so that anyone, anywhere, can prepare with confidence.",
