  "settingsAboutSyllabusTitle": "Syllabus",
  "settingsAboutSyllabus": "Subjects, topics and marks follow the BCS preliminary syllabus published by the Bangladesh Public Service Commission (BPSC).",
  "settingsAboutNewsTitle": "Newspapers",
  "settingsAboutNews": "Our AI reads the following news outlets every morning and picks exam-relevant facts for the daily notes:",
  "settingsAboutNewsLinkNote": "Every note links to its original news source, so you can always verify it.",
  "settingsAboutQuestionsTitle": "Question bank",
  "settingsAboutQuestions": "Every question shows where it comes from — a previous exam, a book, a newspaper or AI generation. AI-made questions are reviewed by moderators; if you spot a mistake, report the question and we'll fix it.",
  "settingsAboutSecurityTitle": "Content protection",
  "settingsAboutSecurity": "This keeps exam questions and premium content safe and fair for everyone who prepares honestly.",
  "settingsAboutLegalTitle": "Legal",
  "settingsAboutPrivacyTitle": "Privacy policy",
  "settingsAboutPrivacy": "We collect only what's needed to run Prostuti: your account details, the profile you fill in, your exam and practice activity, and what you post or send in the community. Personal details such as date of birth and phone number are visible only to you. We never sell your data. Your answers are used to personalise your study plan and to improve question quality. Ads, if shown, are served by Google AdMob. You can ask us to delete your account and data at any time from Settings.",
  "settingsAboutTermsTitle": "Terms of use",
  "settingsAboutTerms": "Prostuti is a study aid. Exam dates and current-affairs notes come from public sources and AI summaries — always confirm official notices with BPSC or the relevant authority. Keep the community respectful: no harassment, spam, cheating material or illegal content. Paid add-ons last for the stated period and do not renew automatically. Copying or redistributing app content is not allowed. We may suspend accounts that break these rules.",
